meta {
  name: FCG APIs
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  X-Correlation-ID: {{correlationId}}
}

vars:pre-request {
  gatewayUrl: http://localhost:8000
  usersUrl: http://localhost:8000
  catalogUrl: http://localhost:8000
  usersHealthUrl: http://localhost:8000/health/users
  catalogHealthUrl: http://localhost:8000/health/catalog
  paymentsUrl: http://localhost:5103
  notificationsUrl: http://localhost:5104
  adminEmail: admin@fcg.com
  adminPassword: AdminSenha@123
  userName: Joao Silva
  userPassword: Senha@123
  correlationId: demo-video-001
}

docs {
  Use o ambiente Docker (Kong em localhost:8000).
  Payments e Notifications ficam nas portas 5103/5104 (nao passam pelo Gateway).
  Tokens e IDs sao gravados em runtime apos Login/Create (vars:post-response).
  Nao declare userToken/adminToken/userId/gameId no ambiente — o valor vazio tapa o da resposta.
}
